{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 0, "start": 1.0, "end": 8.308, "text": "Good afternoon, thank you for calling Northwind Insurance claims. My name is Ayesha. How can I help you today?", "language": "en", "flags": [], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 1, "start": 9.108, "end": 14.492, "text": "Hi Ayesha, I need to report an accident. Someone hit my car yesterday evening.", "language": "en", "flags": [], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 2, "start": 15.192, "end": 18.269, "text": "I'm sorry to hear that. Is everyone okay?", "language": "en", "flags": [], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 3, "start": 18.869, "end": 25.023, "text": "Yes, thankfully nobody was hurt, but the rear bumper and the tail light are badly damaged.", "language": "en", "flags": [], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 4, "start": 25.923, "end": 28.615, "text": "Can I have your policy number please?", "language": "en", "flags": [], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 5, "start": 29.215, "end": 30.369, "text": "Sure, it's POL-48213377.", "language": "en", "flags": [], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 6, "start": 31.169, "end": 34.631, "text": "Thank you. And the best email to reach you?", "language": "en", "flags": [], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 7, "start": 35.131, "end": 39.362, "text": "It's [EMAIL], and my phone number is [PHONE].", "language": "en", "flags": ["redacted_email", "redacted_phone"], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 8, "start": 40.362, "end": 45.746, "text": "Let me put you on a short hold while I pull up the policy.", "language": "en", "flags": [], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 9, "start": 96.246, "end": 100.092, "text": "Thank you for waiting. I have your policy open now.", "language": "en", "flags": [], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 10, "start": 100.292, "end": 108.754, "text": "So it happened around six thirty on the main road near the market and traffic was moving slowly because of the rain", "language": "en", "flags": [], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 11, "start": 108.854, "end": 118.854, "text": "and the car behind me did not stop in time and it went straight into the back of my car and pushed it forward a little", "language": "en", "flags": [], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 12, "start": 118.954, "end": 127.031, "text": "the other driver got out and apologised and we exchanged numbers and took photos of both cars and the number plates", "language": "en", "flags": [], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 13, "start": 127.131, "end": 135.977, "text": "then a police officer came over and wrote down what happened and gave me a reference slip which I still have with me", "language": "en", "flags": [], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 14, "start": 136.077, "end": 145.308, "text": "the bumper is cracked the left tail light is broken and the boot does not close properly anymore so I cannot drive it far", "language": "en", "flags": [], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 15, "start": 145.408, "end": 154.254, "text": "I took it to a garage this morning and they said the estimate would be around four thousand eight hundred and fifty dollars", "language": "en", "flags": [], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 16, "start": 154.354, "end": 158.2, "text": "uh it was the uh other driver's fault I think", "language": "en", "flags": ["low_confidence"], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 17, "start": 158.9, "end": 161.592, "text": "Understood. I've opened claim CLM-2026-004417 for you.", "language": "en", "flags": [], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 18, "start": 165.385, "end": 168.846, "text": "For the deductible, can I take a card number?", "language": "en", "flags": [], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 19, "start": 169.446, "end": 171.754, "text": "Yes, it's [CARD].", "language": "en", "flags": ["redacted_card"], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 20, "start": 177.592, "end": 183.362, "text": "Great, that's all done. An adjuster will call you within two business days. Anything else?", "language": "en", "flags": [], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 21, "start": 184.062, "end": 186.754, "text": "No, that's everything. Thanks for your help.", "language": "en", "flags": [], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"audio_sha256": "c095a919b9350e84e07ab5b29ea5c9d0ace15bc3885e197684fc50a29a3757db", "segment_id": 22, "start": 187.354, "end": 189.662, "text": "You're welcome. Have a good day.", "language": "en", "flags": [], "model": "mock:25", "schema_version": "1.0"}
